  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to pound targets when firing heavy-weapons emplacements and vehicle weaponry.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Heavy_Weapons)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Focus (Heavy Weapons)\">Weapon Focus (Heavy Weapons)</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When making an attack roll using a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Emplacement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Emplacement\">Weapon Emplacement</a> or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_System\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon System\">Weapon System</a>, you add an additional 1 point of damage for every 5 points you roll above the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>. If you exceed the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a>, then on its next turn the target cannot attack and its speed is reduced by 2 squares (1 square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Scale\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship Scale\">Starship Scale</a>).</p>",
